  "text": "24-hour Emergency Vet | BluePearl Pet Hospital | Louisville, KY\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Louisville, KY\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nLouisville, KY\nSpecialty and 24/7 Emergency\n502.244.3036\n13160 Magisterial Dr.\nLouisville, KY 40223\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nMon-Fri: 9 am-6 pm\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nPlease call ahead so we can talk you through your pet’s situation and prepare for your arrival!\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Emergency Vet and Specialty Animal Hospital – serving greater Louisville.\nWe are located in east Louisville and serve the Greater Louisville region, including Clarksville, Jeffersonville, New Albany, and other Kentucky and Indiana communities. We are open after-hours to provide emergency veterinary services when you need us the most.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen your pet needs emergency care, seconds count. Our team is ready to provide expert care in case of a pet emergency, even after-hours. If your pet requires a veterinary specialist, we are ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nAfter-hours Emergency\nEmergency: In an emergency, call ahead to your BluePearl vet and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary for our emergency vet.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nOur veterinary specialists work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Louisville.\nOur 13,500 square-foot, 24-hour vet hospital in Louisville is fully equipped for your pet’s needs.\nWe also are a stable and trusted partner to referring veterinarians and the Louisville community.\nOur hospital features advanced diagnostic equipment such as a 64-slice CT scanner. We also offer interventional radiology, which allows for less invasive solutions to bladder stones and other ailments.\nWe are fully equipped to serve as your emergency animal hospital.\nPet owners.\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n502.244.3036\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“I believe that Dr. Winthrop and the staff at Blue Pearl saved our baby’s life that day. I will forever be thankful for them and they have won a fan for life.” — Thomas\nRead more of\nThomas’ story.\nCurrent location.\n502.244.3036\n502.244.3046\n13160 Magisterial Dr.\nLouisville,\nKY                                    40223\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nNashville, TN\n2409 21st Ave S\nNashville, TN 37212\n615.383.2600\n164.25 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrentwood, TN\n1569 Mallory Ln., Bldg 200\nBrentwood, TN 37027\n615.333.1212\n173.45 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nSkokie, IL\n3735 Dempster St\nSkokie, IL 60076\n847.673.9110\n285.63 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
